								<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
									Available for design systems, editorial operations, and communications work. Based in Minneapolis.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="grid gap-px bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800">
								<a href="mailto:anthonyrosen@gmail.com" class="bg-white px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:text-blue-600 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 dark:hover:text-blue-300">anthonyrosen@gmail.com</a>
								<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/anthonyrosen" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="bg-white px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:text-blue-600 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 dark:hover:text-blue-300">linkedin.com/in/anthonyrosen</a>
